OL,3,GNEWSAClaims 'stabbed' woman tried to
OL,4,Adrive to hospital because of ambulance
OL,5,Await time denied
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh Ambulance Service has denied
OL,8,Fthat a woman who died after crashing a
OL,9,Fcar into a wall after suffering "stab
OL,10,Fwounds" was driving because of
OL,11,Fambulance wait times.
OL,13,FEleanor Barnfield, 47, died in hospital
OL,14,Fafter police were called to the crash
OL,15,Fin Bridgend on Monday, where they found
OL,16,Fshe had "puncture wounds unrelated to
OL,17,Fthe collision", which the BBC
OL,18,Funderstands were sustained in a
OL,19,Fstabbing.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
