OL,3,GNEWSAClaims 'stabbed' woman tried to
OL,4,Adrive to hospital because of ambulance
OL,5,Await time denied
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 61-year-old man from Bridgend, who
OL,8,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fmurder, remains in custody.
OL,11,FThe ambulance service said it was aware
OL,12,Fof "misleading rumours" circulating
OL,13,Fonline but said medics were called to
OL,14,Fthe crash in Coity Road at about 12:44
OL,15,FBST and a response unit arrived seven
OL,16,Fminutes later.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
